<title>UK: Woolwich 4-day auction average 296.51p/shr.</title>
<headline>Woolwich 4-day auction average 296.51p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-floated Woolwich Plc said on Friday that the average price of its four auctions and the amount payable to shareholders selling their shares at auction was 296.5081p per share.</p>
<p>The average price of bids at the fourth and final auction of 92.553 million shares held on Thursday was 292.5035p per share.</p>
<p>Woolwich made its debut on the London Stock Exchange on Monday at 368p before closing at 334p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
